{"seq":1,"slug":"satyagraha","title":"真理坚固","docCount":2,"url":"/c/leaders/mahatma-gandhi/political-thought/satyagraha","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-philosophy-of-satyagraha","title":"真理坚固的哲学","url":"/c/leaders/mahatma-gandhi/political-thought/satyagraha/the-philosophy-of-satyagraha","wordCount":1697,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"truth-as-a-force","title":"真理作为力量","url":"/c/leaders/mahatma-gandhi/political-thought/satyagraha/truth-as-a-force","wordCount":1992,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"# 真理坚固\n\n\"真理坚固\"，是甘地政治思想的核心。本章剖析这一伟大的思想。\n\n第一篇文档讲述\"真理坚固的哲学\"——以坚守真理、非暴力、承受苦难对抗不公的智慧。第二篇文档讲述\"真理作为力量\",呈现真理在甘地思想中至高无上的地位与力量。\n"}